{"id":5832,"date_gmt":"2026-03-26T17:26:57","modified_gmt":"2026-05-20T13:42:06","slug":"pathways","link":"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/","title":{"rendered":"Contributor Pathways"},"content":{"rendered":"Want to give back to WordPress but don&#8217;t know where to begin? Browse the sections below for quick guides to evergreen contribution pathways that are always open and always need help, or <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/all-guides\/\">view all guides here<\/a>. The <a href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/orgs\/WordPress\/projects\/289\/views\/1?pane=info\">Good First Issues board<\/a> also has specific one-off tasks that need doing now.\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>New contributors:<\/strong> <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/before-you-begin\">Get access<\/a>, plus best practices, how to find help, and how to earn contributor badges. <\/li>\n<li><strong>Teams:<\/strong> Want to add your own guides? <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/project\/2026\/04\/23\/help-us-help-others-contribute-to-wordpress\">Learn more about the project here<\/a>.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-default has-blueberry-1-color has-text-color has-link-color has-eb-garamond-font-family has-huge-font-size wp-elements-1\"><span class=\"dashicons dashicons-editor-code\"><\/span> <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/build\/\" data-type=\"handbook\" data-id=\"5838\">Build<\/a><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:var(--wp--preset--color--charcoal-4)\">For developers and tinkerers who want to write code, build tools, or improve existing projects. You could <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/build\/create-a-playground-blueprint\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">build a Playground Blueprint<\/a> that showcases a WordPress capability in a single click, or <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/build\/contribute-to-gatherpress\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">contribute to GatherPress<\/a> to help power WordPress Student Clubs. <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/build\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>All Build guides <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">\u2192<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-default has-blueberry-1-color has-text-color has-link-color has-eb-garamond-font-family has-huge-font-size wp-elements-2\"><span class=\"dashicons dashicons-art\"><\/span> <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/design\/\" data-type=\"handbook\" data-id=\"5840\">Design<\/a><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:var(--wp--preset--color--charcoal-4)\">For designers, photographers, and anyone with an eye for how things look and work. You could <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/design\/contribute-to-photos\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">submit your photos to the WordPress Photo Directory<\/a> for thousands of people to use, or <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/design\/submit-block-patterns\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">create block patterns<\/a> that give site builders better starting points. <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/design\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>All Design guides <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">\u2192<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-default has-blueberry-1-color has-text-color has-link-color has-eb-garamond-font-family has-huge-font-size wp-elements-3\"><span class=\"dashicons dashicons-edit\"><\/span> <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/write\/\" data-type=\"handbook\" data-id=\"5842\">Write<\/a><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:var(--wp--preset--color--charcoal-4)\">For writers and editors who want to improve documentation, create guides, or develop learning content. You could <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/write\/create-content-for-learn-wordpress\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">create content for Learn WordPress<\/a> to help people level up their skills, or just <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/write\/file-a-documentation-issue\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">file a documentation issue<\/a> when you spot something wrong: no fix needed, just flag it. <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/write\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>All Write guides <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">\u2192<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-default has-blueberry-1-color has-text-color has-link-color has-eb-garamond-font-family has-huge-font-size wp-elements-4\"><span class=\"dashicons dashicons-yes-alt\"><\/span> <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/test\/\" data-type=\"handbook\" data-id=\"5844\">Test<\/a><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:var(--wp--preset--color--charcoal-4)\">For detail-oriented people who want to find bugs, verify fixes, or review content. You could <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/test\/help-test-beta-releases\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">test WordPress beta releases<\/a> before they ship to millions of sites, or <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/test\/test-for-accessibility\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">test for accessibility<\/a> to make sure WordPress works for everyone. You can even make this project better by <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/test\/review-a-pathway-guide\/\">reviewing a guide<\/a>. <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/test\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>All Test guides <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">\u2192<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-default has-blueberry-1-color has-text-color has-link-color has-eb-garamond-font-family has-huge-font-size wp-elements-5\"><span class=\"dashicons dashicons-translation\"><\/span> <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/translate\/\" data-type=\"handbook\" data-id=\"5843\">Translate<\/a><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:var(--wp--preset--color--charcoal-4)\">For multilingual contributors who want to make WordPress accessible in more languages. Right now you can <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/translate\/translate-training-content\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">translate training content<\/a> so learners worldwide can study in their own language. More guides are on the way.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-default has-blueberry-1-color has-text-color has-link-color has-eb-garamond-font-family has-huge-font-size wp-elements-6\"><span class=\"dashicons dashicons-groups\"><\/span> <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/organize\/\" data-type=\"handbook\" data-id=\"5845\">Organize<\/a><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:var(--wp--preset--color--charcoal-4)\">For people who like coordinating, triaging, and keeping things running smoothly. From could <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/organize\/volunteer-at-a-wordpress-event\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">volunteering at a WordPress event<\/a> near you to <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/organize\/triage-gutenberg-project\/\">triaging issues in Gutenberg<\/a>, or even <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/organize\/suggest-a-pathway\/\">suggesting new Pathway Guides<\/a>. <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/organize\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>All Organize guides <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">\u2192<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-default has-blueberry-1-color has-text-color has-link-color has-eb-garamond-font-family has-huge-font-size wp-elements-7\"><span class=\"dashicons dashicons-megaphone\"><\/span> <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/promote\/\" data-type=\"handbook\" data-id=\"5847\">Promote<\/a><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:var(--wp--preset--color--charcoal-4)\">For communicators who want to help spread the word and grow the community. You could <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/promote\/add-captions-to-wptv-videos\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">add captions to WordPress.tv videos<\/a> so talks reach a wider audience, or <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/promote\/promote-a-local-wordpress-event\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">promote a local WordPress event<\/a> to bring new people in. <a href=\"https:\/\/make.wordpress.org\/handbook\/pathways\/promote\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>All Promote guides <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">\u2192<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n","protected":false},"parent":0}